375
00:15:34,094 --> 00:15:35,694
- Did you already order?
- Yes.

376
00:15:35,694 --> 00:15:36,794
Good.

377
00:15:36,794 --> 00:15:39,034
- Can we get the menu?
- Of course.

378
00:15:39,564 --> 00:15:40,934
Here's the menu.

379
00:15:41,764 --> 00:15:43,964
- Do I tick the boxes?
- Yes.

380
00:15:44,134 --> 00:15:45,404
What should I order?

381
00:15:45,404 --> 00:15:47,434
Customers usually order...

382
00:15:47,674 --> 00:15:50,474
We serve pork cutlet, hamburger steak, and shrimp fried rice.

383
00:15:50,474 --> 00:15:51,974
It's 17 dollars, 18 dollars,

384
00:15:51,974 --> 00:15:53,914
- and 14 dollars.
- How much is the total?

385
00:15:54,244 --> 00:15:55,844
The total is 51 dollars for 3 dishes.

386
00:15:55,844 --> 00:15:57,444
- Order those for us.
- Three dishes?

387
00:15:57,584 --> 00:15:58,884
Should we all get soba?

388
00:15:58,984 --> 00:16:00,314
No, it's...

389
00:16:00,514 --> 00:16:02,084
You don't just order soba.

390
00:16:02,624 --> 00:16:06,254
If you add soba to the cheese pork cutlet,

391
00:16:06,254 --> 00:16:07,794
(Jumbo pork cutlet and soba set)

392
00:16:07,794 --> 00:16:10,194
it's 16.90 dollars and 2.90 dollars in tax.

393
00:16:10,764 --> 00:16:13,094
I only want soba.

394
00:16:13,094 --> 00:16:15,404
- Just leave.
- Go.

395
00:16:16,364 --> 00:16:18,304
- Jumbo pork cutlet.
- One jumbo pork cutlet.

396
00:16:18,604 --> 00:16:19,704
- Excuse me.
- Chef.

397
00:16:19,704 --> 00:16:21,844
We only enjoy expensive food.

398
00:16:22,304 --> 00:16:23,344
Thank you.

399
00:16:23,344 --> 00:16:24,444
Can I go inside?

400
00:16:24,444 --> 00:16:25,974
You have to. Go inside.

401
00:16:25,974 --> 00:16:27,244
Leave whatever you're not done with.

402
00:16:27,244 --> 00:16:28,584
- Hurry up. Go.
- Okay.

403
00:16:28,584 --> 00:16:29,644
Get moving.

404
00:16:30,144 --> 00:16:31,184
- Jong In.
- Yes?

405
00:16:31,184 --> 00:16:32,814
We've got about 20 teams. I'll hurry.

406
00:16:33,614 --> 00:16:36,054
(The pre-fried pork cutlets are plated right away.)

407
00:16:36,054 --> 00:16:37,054
Is there more?

408
00:16:37,054 --> 00:16:39,324
One pork cutlet and one hamburger steak have been plated.

409
00:16:39,324 --> 00:16:40,654
Jong In, there are 20 teams...

410
00:16:40,654 --> 00:16:42,794
Three pork cutlets and three hamburger steaks first, please.

411
00:16:42,794 --> 00:16:43,864
Okay.

412
00:16:44,394 --> 00:16:46,334
- I'm matching your pace.
- Did we pre-cook some?

413
00:16:46,734 --> 00:16:49,134
No, more needs to be deep-fried. For now...

414
00:16:49,934 --> 00:16:51,234
Three of each, please.

415
00:16:52,034 --> 00:16:53,334
I'll be cooking them soon.

416
00:16:53,334 --> 00:16:54,844
Okay. There are over 20 customers outside.

417
00:16:54,844 --> 00:16:56,574
- Got it. Don't worry too much.
- Okay.

418
00:16:56,744 --> 00:16:58,044
Keep calm, Hoon.

419
00:16:58,374 --> 00:16:59,374
Okay.

420
00:16:59,874 --> 00:17:02,784
Three pork cutlets. Three hamburger steaks. One set.

421
00:17:02,784 --> 00:17:03,844
- Serve them.
- Okay.

422
00:17:04,184 --> 00:17:06,584
Three pork cutlets. Three hamburger steaks.

423
00:17:06,814 --> 00:17:07,854
Got it.

424
00:17:09,024 --> 00:17:10,884
(Kim Hoon is off to prepare...)

425
00:17:10,884 --> 00:17:12,754
(3 pork cutlets and 3 hamburger steaks.)

426
00:17:12,754 --> 00:17:14,864
(Completed pork cutlets: 0, Completed hamburger steaks: 0)

427
00:17:14,864 --> 00:17:16,494
(Completed hamburger steaks: 2)

428
00:17:18,564 --> 00:17:20,534
(Completed hamburger steaks: 2)

429
00:17:20,534 --> 00:17:23,804
(Completed hamburger steaks: 3)

430
00:17:23,804 --> 00:17:27,134
(Completed pork cutlets: 1)

431
00:17:27,134 --> 00:17:30,004
(Completed pork cutlets: 3)

432
00:17:30,774 --> 00:17:33,874
(Completed the mission of 3 pork cutlets and 3 hamburger steaks)

433
00:17:34,744 --> 00:17:35,914
Three hamburger steaks.

434
00:17:36,284 --> 00:17:37,284
(Focused)

435
00:17:37,284 --> 00:17:38,284
Okay.

436
00:17:39,214 --> 00:17:41,684
- Have you not ordered yet?
- No.

437
00:17:41,684 --> 00:17:43,354
- I'm sorry.
- She's the oldest out here.

438
00:17:43,354 --> 00:17:44,524
So you haven't ordered yet.

439
00:17:44,524 --> 00:17:45,824
Here's an order slip.

440
00:17:45,824 --> 00:17:47,124
Please tick the box.

441
00:17:47,124 --> 00:17:49,864
Please tick what you'd like to eat.

442
00:17:50,394 --> 00:17:54,094
(Focused on the food ready to serve)

443
00:17:54,794 --> 00:17:56,934
(Peeking)

444
00:17:56,934 --> 00:17:59,834
(Focused)

445
00:17:59,834 --> 00:18:02,544
The ladies' necks are out this much.

446
00:18:02,704 --> 00:18:04,874
Everyone is watching the kitchen.

447
00:18:04,874 --> 00:18:05,914
Exactly.

448
00:18:06,114 --> 00:18:08,844
(Staring)

449
00:18:08,944 --> 00:18:10,514
- Serve those, please.
- Okay.

450
00:18:10,514 --> 00:18:11,514
Good.

451
00:18:12,184 --> 00:18:13,254
Here it is.

452
00:18:13,854 --> 00:18:15,754
Who ordered the hamburger steak?

453
00:18:15,954 --> 00:18:17,454
Here's the pork cutlet.

454
00:18:18,694 --> 00:18:20,454
(Meanwhile, alone in the kitchen,)

455
00:18:21,294 --> 00:18:23,464
(Jong In is fighting a lonely battle.)

456
00:18:23,464 --> 00:18:25,964
(After plating the pork cutlets,)

457
00:18:26,694 --> 00:18:28,964
(he turns and cooks the pork cutlets.)

458
00:18:31,804 --> 00:18:33,574
Jong In, eight pork cutlets all day.

459
00:18:34,574 --> 00:18:36,644
(He's already finished 6 pork cutlets.)

460
00:18:40,444 --> 00:18:41,714
The pork cutlets are ready.

461
00:18:42,614 --> 00:18:44,414
(The dishes are ready faster than they are served.)

462
00:18:44,414 --> 00:18:47,784
Is Jong In doing a one-man show in the kitchen all alone?

463
00:18:48,054 --> 00:18:49,784
- He's alone in the kitchen.
- I feel bad for him.

464
00:18:49,784 --> 00:18:51,924
- For real.
- I feel terrible for him right now.

465
00:18:52,254 --> 00:18:54,794
(A kitchen one-man show)

466
00:18:55,124 --> 00:18:57,064
(Quietly powering through in the kitchen,)

467
00:18:57,064 --> 00:19:00,764
(Jong In sends out dish after dish.)

468
00:19:00,764 --> 00:19:04,534
He's someone with vast experience in cooking.

469
00:19:05,274 --> 00:19:07,504
Jong In gets things done calmly.

470
00:19:07,704 --> 00:19:09,874
Two fried rice will be ready first.

471
00:19:10,704 --> 00:19:12,114
The fried rice is ready.

472
00:19:13,344 --> 00:19:15,044
- Three fried rice, yes?
- Yes.

473
00:19:15,044 --> 00:19:17,314
And one pork cutlet, right?

474
00:19:17,314 --> 00:19:18,314
Thanks.

475
00:19:18,314 --> 00:19:19,414
All set, right?

476
00:19:19,414 --> 00:19:22,254
Another fried rice and one pork cutlet.

477
00:19:22,254 --> 00:19:23,624
All orders have been served, right?

478
00:19:23,624 --> 00:19:26,654
- One... We got one new order.
- Got it.

479
00:19:26,654 --> 00:19:28,564
- Only one last order left, right?
- Yes.

480
00:19:29,124 --> 00:19:31,424
(With the joint effort of chef slash server Kim Hoon,)

481
00:19:32,034 --> 00:19:34,734
(13 tables have been served.)

482
00:19:35,134 --> 00:19:36,164
All orders have been served.

483
00:19:36,164 --> 00:19:38,734
(And now, even the very last order ticket...)

484
00:19:38,734 --> 00:19:41,174
(has been cleared.)

485
00:19:41,434 --> 00:19:43,804
- Go ahead.
- Try it first.

486
00:19:45,474 --> 00:19:47,174
- It's good.
- Yes, it's not bad.

487
00:19:48,514 --> 00:19:49,914
There's rice in here.

488
00:19:49,914 --> 00:19:51,314
- What?
- There's rice in here.

489
00:19:51,314 --> 00:19:53,114
- Rice?
- Yes.

490
00:19:54,384 --> 00:19:55,924
Here's a piece of pork cutlet.

491
00:19:56,454 --> 00:19:58,854
