01:25:18,484 --> 01:25:20,854
(The final winners, Kim Hoon and Kim Jong In)

2061
01:25:20,854 --> 01:25:22,224
Good job.

2062
01:25:25,324 --> 01:25:26,634
This is so cool.

2063
01:25:26,764 --> 01:25:27,994
This is awesome!

2064
01:25:30,234 --> 01:25:32,674
Because I've only been staying...

2065
01:25:32,674 --> 01:25:35,074
in the kitchen until now,

2066
01:25:35,504 --> 01:25:38,074
sometimes I did act clumsily.

2067
01:25:38,204 --> 01:25:42,214
It was a chance for me to watch and learn from other chefs.

2068
01:25:42,784 --> 01:25:43,884
I knew they'd win.

2069
01:25:44,044 --> 01:25:45,984
- They're strategists.
- Cool.

2070
01:25:45,984 --> 01:25:47,584
They have the best instincts.

2071
01:25:48,254 --> 01:25:51,084
Running a restaurant is actually very hard.

2072
01:25:51,524 --> 01:25:53,524
There's no balance between work and life.

2073
01:25:53,524 --> 01:25:55,994
Because I never gave up,

2074
01:25:55,994 --> 01:25:57,864
I gained a good opportunity.

2075
01:25:58,394 --> 01:26:00,094
We began in Australia.

2076
01:26:00,634 --> 01:26:02,164
We worked at a fine dining restaurant together.

2077
01:26:03,464 --> 01:26:05,934
Then we worked at a three Michelin star restaurant in the US.

2078
01:26:07,204 --> 01:26:08,634
When I was working at the three star restaurant,

2079
01:26:08,634 --> 01:26:11,144
my parents came to visit me, but they couldn't try the food.

2080
01:26:11,144 --> 01:26:12,944
Because the place I used to work at...

2081
01:26:12,944 --> 01:26:14,614
cost 500 dollars, including the wine.

2082
01:26:14,614 --> 01:26:16,544
So I began cooking...

2083
01:26:16,784 --> 01:26:19,254
to cook for people I love.

2084
01:26:20,054 --> 01:26:21,114
That's when I realised...

2085
01:26:21,114 --> 01:26:23,254
my family couldn't try my food...

2086
01:26:23,254 --> 01:26:24,624
even though I worked at a luxurious restaurant.

2087
01:26:24,624 --> 01:26:28,354
So I decided to switch to popular food.

2088
01:26:28,354 --> 01:26:30,994
(That's how Kim Hoon began making popular food.)

2089
01:26:30,994 --> 01:26:33,094
People often said,

2090
01:26:33,094 --> 01:26:35,464
"He said he worked at a fine dining restaurant in the US."

2091
01:26:35,464 --> 01:26:36,534
"But he's selling popular food?"

2092
01:26:36,534 --> 01:26:39,804
That degraded my self-esteem.

2093
01:26:39,804 --> 01:26:42,974
I had to prove myself every day.

2094
01:26:43,244 --> 01:26:44,304
Oh, my gosh.

2095
01:26:48,744 --> 01:26:50,914
I'm full of an inferiority complex.

2096
01:26:50,914 --> 01:26:53,654
To be honest,

2097
01:26:53,654 --> 01:26:56,284
I didn't major in cooking.

2098
01:26:56,284 --> 01:26:57,424
I began cooking very late.

2099
01:26:58,524 --> 01:27:00,724
After this survival competition,

2100
01:27:01,424 --> 01:27:03,164
I wish to escape from my inferiority complex.

2101
01:27:04,224 --> 01:27:05,494
I'll...

2102
01:27:06,434 --> 01:27:08,164
- Good job.
- You did a good job.

2103
01:27:08,164 --> 01:27:09,434
- Good job.
- Nice.

2104
01:27:12,834 --> 01:27:15,304
- You're awesome.
- I'll do...

2105
01:27:15,304 --> 01:27:16,344
- Good job.
- You did a good job.

2106
01:27:16,344 --> 01:27:17,504
- my best.
- Good job.

2107
01:27:17,504 --> 01:27:18,574
Thank you.

2108
01:27:21,014 --> 01:27:23,944
Everything I've done wasn't in vain.

2109
01:27:24,144 --> 01:27:27,084
I feel like I've been rewarded.

2110
01:27:29,684 --> 01:27:31,684
The mission ended today,

2111
01:27:32,054 --> 01:27:34,424
but our game will continue.

2112
01:27:40,534 --> 01:27:42,164
A business is...

2113
01:27:42,164 --> 01:27:44,334
a type of survival competition.

2114
01:27:44,334 --> 01:27:47,104
That's what everyone is doing every day.

2115
01:27:47,204 --> 01:27:49,174
I've been running a business for a very long time.

2116
01:27:49,844 --> 01:27:51,844
Running a business regardless of your skills...

2117
01:27:51,974 --> 01:27:55,874
I think running a business is a form of art.

2118
01:27:55,874 --> 01:27:57,214
(Fine art)

2119
01:27:57,214 --> 01:27:59,244
Running a business is love.

2120
01:27:59,244 --> 01:28:02,824
(Love)

2121
01:28:02,824 --> 01:28:03,884
You never know how a business will do...

2122
01:28:04,184 --> 01:28:06,154
until you try.

2123
01:28:06,394 --> 01:28:08,854
No matter how famous the chef is...

2124
01:28:09,054 --> 01:28:10,824
It's a long journey until people pay.

2125
01:28:11,494 --> 01:28:12,794
Should I change the menu?

2126
01:28:12,994 --> 01:28:15,734
No matter how good your cooking skills are,

2127
01:28:16,264 --> 01:28:17,934
no one will know until you try.

2128
01:28:17,934 --> 01:28:19,434
I think we picked the wrong menu.

2129
01:28:19,634 --> 01:28:20,804
Why aren't we getting any orders?

2130
01:28:20,804 --> 01:28:22,534
We're not doing well when there's a market.

2131
01:28:22,534 --> 01:28:23,974
Should we lower the price?

2132
01:28:23,974 --> 01:28:26,444
(It makes you desperate because there is no right answer.)

2133
01:28:26,444 --> 01:28:29,014
I should never be arrogant when it comes to a business.

2134
01:28:29,014 --> 01:28:31,914
I feel like I'm thrown into a brutal world.

2135
01:28:31,914 --> 01:28:34,514
As someone who's running a business...

2136
01:28:34,714 --> 01:28:37,584
(It wasn't much different from reality.)

2137
01:28:37,584 --> 01:28:39,854
It's actually very tough working in a restaurant.

2138
01:28:40,024 --> 01:28:42,554
It's hard to survive every day, but...

2139
01:28:42,554 --> 01:28:44,924
(Yet,)

2140
01:28:44,924 --> 01:28:46,394
(we were happy.)

2141
01:28:46,394 --> 01:28:50,134
(I wanted to run my own restaurant.)

2142
01:28:51,504 --> 01:28:54,974
(Joy to approach the customers)

2143
01:28:56,504 --> 01:28:59,644
(A business that changed their lives)

2144
01:28:59,644 --> 01:29:02,814
It felt like I was back in time,

2145
01:29:02,814 --> 01:29:04,444
when I first started my business.

2146
01:29:04,544 --> 01:29:08,384
What you've seen is just one small page.

2147
01:29:08,714 --> 01:29:11,154
(I can't wait to find out what happens after this.)

2148
01:29:11,484 --> 01:29:14,894
(For the story of every Street Restaurant Fighters...)

2149
01:29:15,224 --> 01:29:18,894
(that is taking place in countless commercial zones)

2150
01:29:18,964 --> 01:29:21,664
The game never ends until we die.

2151
01:29:22,134 --> 01:29:26,974
(Street Restaurant Fighter)
